*> vybe-test: cobol/qualified_names_of_clause/qualified_three_level_deep
*> origin: languages/cobol/tests/cobol/test_qualified_names_of_clause.rs
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. T.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 OUTER.
   05 MIDDLE.
      10 INNER PIC X(5) VALUE "DEEP".
01 WS-VYBE-L PIC X(256).
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    DISPLAY INNER OF MIDDLE OF OUTER.
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-VYBE-L
    STRING INNER DELIMITED SIZE OF DELIMITED SIZE MIDDLE DELIMITED SIZE OF DELIMITED SIZE OUTER DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-VYBE-L
    IF WS-VYBE-L NOT = "DEEP "
        DISPLAY "FAIL: want [DEEP ] got [" WS-VYBE-L "]"
        MOVE 1 TO RETURN-CODE
        RAISE EXCEPTION EC-PROGRAM
    END-IF.
    STOP RUN.

